; reg --gain adds a cost kept at full precision to a lot of the same
; commodity and prints the sum at full precision, on every run.
;
; --gain shows each posting's market value less its cost.  The bare amount
; -100 has no commodity, hence no market value, so its gain holds its cost
; negated, 33.3333 EUR (100 at 0.333333 EUR), kept at full precision as
; costs are; the lot 100.00 EUR {5} is not revalued either, EUR being a
; price commodity here.  --lots shows both in the running total, and the
; default display strips the lot's annotation and adds them into
; 133.3333 EUR.  Adding two amounts keeps only the left one's
; full-precision flag, so with the lot first the sum would print as
; 133.33 EUR.  Ledger used to add the components in the order in which the
; balance kept them, which put the cost first here on every run.  That
; order now changes from run to run, so a merged amount keeps full
; precision whenever one of its parts did, whichever is added first.
;
; The second journal, where this was found, is 1E192DF6.test's with a
; neutral payee: line 9 of its reg --gain adds 199,99977356 GBP to the lot
; 400,00 GBP {4.8799} and prints 599,99977356 GBP, as it always did
; (600,00 GBP would be the lot-first sum).  --lot-notes keeps only lot
; notes, which these lots lack, so it merges the same way.  -p picks one
; journal per block.  Each block runs Ledger afresh, so adding in the
; order in which the balance keeps its components would pass all four
; merging blocks on about one run in sixteen.

2024/01/01 Buy euros
    Assets:Euros          100.00 EUR @ 5
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/02 Pay cash
    Assets:Cash             -100 @ 0.333333 EUR
    Assets:Euros           33.33 EUR

; The journal of 1E192DF6.test, with a neutral payee.
D 1000,00 PLN
N $
N h
N PLN
N zł
C 1,00 PLN = 1,00

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
    Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP @ 4,8799 PLN  ; fikimiki
    Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
    Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP @ 4,8799 PLN  ; fikimiki
    Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
   Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN @ 0,204922 GBP
   Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP ; fikimiki

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
   Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN @ 0,204922 GBP
   Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP ; fikimiki

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
   Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP @ 4,8799 PLN  ; fikimiki
   Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN

2010-05-19 * Currency exchange
   Assets:Checking:Konto24 GBP               200,00 GBP @ 4,8799 PLN  ; fikimiki
   Assets:Checking:Konto<30                 -975,98 PLN

test reg --gain --lots -p 2024
24-Jan-01 Buy euros             Assets:Euros                   -500
                                        100.00 EUR {5} [2024/01/01]         -500
                                                     100.00 EUR {5} [2024/01/01]
24-Jan-02 Pay cash              Assets:Cash                    -100
                                                        33.3333 EUR         -600
                                                                     33.3333 EUR
                                                     100.00 EUR {5} [2024/01/01]
end test

